          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Hushai akawaambia Sadoki na Abiathari, makuhani, Ahithofeli amempa Absalomu na wazee wa Israeli mashauri kadha wa kadha; na mimi nimetoa mashauri kadha wa kadha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi sasa pelekeni habari upesi, kamwambieni Daudi ya kwamba, Usilale usiku huu karibu na vivuko vya jangwani; bali usikose kuvuka; asije akamezwa mfalme, na watu wote walio pamoja naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
