        },
        {
          "text": " Nao watumishi wa Absalomu wakamwendea yule mwanamke mle nyumbani; wakasema, Wako wapi Yonathani na Ahimaasi? Yule mwanamke akawaambia, Wamevuka kijito cha maji. Basi walipokwisha kuwatafuta wasiwaone, wakarudi Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
